<p>Creates a button that links to a URL</p>
<b>Parameters</b>
<ul><li> href = URL to link to</li>
<li> target = Link target (e.g., "externalTab", "_blank")</li>
<li> text = Button text</li>
</ul>
<xmp class="panel" of-exclude="true">
<!--Extension LinkButton href="https://www.bbc.co.uk" target="externalTab" text="BBC" --><a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk" target="externalTab" class="button small">BBC</a><!--End Extension LinkButton href="https://www.bbc.co.uk" target="externalTab" text="BBC" -->
</xmp>

